How long do reconfigurations take? The distribution of path lengths over random instances:

{{visualization:2}}

## 4. Rank one, solved completely

At rank one, every basis is a singleton, and the fingerprint determines the configuration outright — so two configurations with equal fingerprints are *identical*. Explore this rigidity: edit a bag of singletons, read off the fingerprint, and rebuild the configuration from the fingerprint alone.

