## Where this goes next

The congruence theory plus the two-basis move reduce the general uniform case to a single **extraction lemma**; granting it, White's Part 3 follows for all uniform matroids by induction on configuration size. Beyond uniform matroids, the same template targets the strongly base-orderable class. The bag of singletons is fully understood — the rest of the fleet awaits.
